WEBVTT

00:03:59.055 --> 00:04:03.522
says to me, "Josh, you're
an American journalist.

00:04:03.546 --> 00:04:05.482
Do you know Britney Spears?"

00:04:06.023 --> 00:04:10.112
I'm like, "What? No. Why?"

00:04:10.763 --> 00:04:13.193
"Because I really want
to teach Britney Spears

00:04:13.217 --> 00:04:16.097
how to memorize the order
of a shuffled pack of playing cards

00:04:16.121 --> 00:04:17.907
on U.S. national television.

00:04:17.931 --> 00:04:21.010
It will prove to the world
that anybody can do this."

00:04:21.034 --> 00:04:24.410
(Laughter)

00:04:26.263 --> 00:04:29.716
I was like, "Well, I'm not Britney Spears,

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.709
but maybe you could teach me.